      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Any-to-Bokeh: MANUAL rack focus (schedule / keyframes)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "> Nodes from https://github.com/alexanz314/ComfyUI-AnyToBokeh\n\n# Any-to-Bokeh - rack focus without regeneration\n\n**Upstream** [vivoCameraResearch/any-to-bokeh](https://github.com/vivoCameraResearch/any-to-bokeh) - **Paper** [arXiv:2505.21593](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21593) (ICLR 2026)\n\nSharp master -> depth (DA3) -> focal plane -> bokeh. The master stays **frozen**, so the subject cannot drift between takes: re-rendering a new focal plane is a deterministic pass, not a regeneration.\n\n---\n\n## Required files\n\n| # | Path | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `models/any2bokeh/unet/` (7.5 GB) | upstream Google Drive, see their README |\n| 2 | `models/any2bokeh/vae/` (393 MB) | same archive |\n| 3 | `models/any2bokeh/svd_xt/` | [stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt) |\n| 4 | `models/geometry_estimation/depth_anything_3_mono_large.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/Depth-Anything-3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Depth-Anything-3) |\n| 5 | `models/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/sam3.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam3.1) |\n\n### SVD-XT: fetch only the slice diffusers needs (~1.2 GiB, not 21.5 GiB)\n\n```\n/home/user/work/ComfyUI/venv/bin/hf download stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt \\\n  --local-dir /home/user/work/ComfyUI/models/any2bokeh/svd_xt \\\n  --include \"model_index.json\" \"LICENSE.md\" \"scheduler/*\" \"feature_extractor/*\" \\\n            \"image_encoder/config.json\" \"image_encoder/model.fp16.safetensors\" \\\n            \"unet/config.json\" \"vae/config.json\"\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "> Nodes from https://github.com/alexanz314/ComfyUI-AnyToBokeh\n\n# Any-to-Bokeh - rack focus without regeneration\n\n**Upstream** [vivoCameraResearch/any-to-bokeh](https://github.com/vivoCameraResearch/any-to-bokeh) - **Paper** [arXiv:2505.21593](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21593) (ICLR 2026)\n\nSharp master -> depth (DA3) -> focal plane -> bokeh. The master stays **frozen**, so the subject cannot drift between takes: re-rendering a new focal plane is a deterministic pass, not a regeneration.\n\n---\n\n## Required files\n\n| # | Path | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `models/any2bokeh/unet/` (7.5 GB) | upstream Google Drive, see their README |\n| 2 | `models/any2bokeh/vae/` (393 MB) | same archive |\n| 3 | `models/any2bokeh/svd_xt/` | [stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt) |\n| 4 | `models/geometry_estimation/depth_anything_3_mono_large.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/Depth-Anything-3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Depth-Anything-3) |\n| 5 | `models/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors` | [Comfy-Org/sam3.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam3.1) |\n\n### SVD-XT: fetch only the slice diffusers needs (~1.2 GiB, not 21.5 GiB)\n\n```\n/home/user/work/ComfyUI/venv/bin/hf download stabilityai/stable-video-diffusion-img2vid-xt \\\n  --local-dir /home/user/work/ComfyUI/models/any2bokeh/svd_xt \\\n  --include \"model_index.json\" \"LICENSE.md\" \"scheduler/*\" \"feature_extractor/*\" \\\n            \"image_encoder/config.json\" \"image_encoder/model.fp16.safetensors\" \\\n            \"unet/config.json\" \"vae/config.json\"\n```\n\n"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
